Why can one word become multiple tokens?

a new product name, or a word with an unfamiliar spelling.
A tokenizer can represent it using smaller pieces from its vocabulary instead of requiring a separate vocabulary entry for every possible word.
This helps balance vocabulary size and the ability to represent unfamiliar words.

